---

Please keep in mind that resource packs are provided as-is, and we do not offer support for them. That being said, you can follow the troubleshooting guide to try to get the resource packs feature working.
**🔧 Resource Pack Troubleshooting Guide**

If the resource pack isn't appearing on your console, try these steps:

**🔄 Quick Fixes:**
• **Clear the pack cache** - Since we merge your pack with the server's resource pack you need to clear all the packs in the cache so your client accepts the new one
• **Try with another pack** - The resource pack you are using might be broken or outdated, try using another one
• **Try with another server** - The server you are trying to use your pack with might not have a server resource pack so we can't merge your pack with it, or server might be blocking the pack
